<title>USA: Hartmarx Corp Q4 Nov 30 net up.</title>
<headline>Hartmarx Corp Q4 Nov 30 net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.73		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net			 24,034		   22,187</p>
<p> Revs		     160,163		  144,301</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.74		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net			 24,555		    3,147</p>
<p> Revs		     610,180		  595,272</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year net and shr include extraordinary gain of $725,000, or $0.02/shr, on purchase of senior subordinated debentures. 1995 year net and shr include loss from discontinued operation of $18.1 million, or $0.56/shr, net of $400,000 tax benefit, related to Kuppenheimer disposition.</p>
<p>Earnings per share before extraordinary items was $0.72 for 1996 year and $0.66 for 1995 year.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
